    "save failures preserve inputs; pending operations prevent duplicate save and navigation",
    "invalid or unavailable drafts cannot be overwritten with an empty form and support retry",
    "all batches, cross-batch selection, isolated style selections",
    "submit and material actions stay enabled with missing business inputs; immediate validation explains missing images, remark and material selection before confirmation; valid submission sends final context and style payloads; errors preserve inputs",
